The libraries of ImageMagick 6 of azsupport/ports (JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF, HEIC
and AVIF only): libMagickCore-6.Q16 and libMagickWand-6.Q16 in /usr/local/az/lib
with their headers, .pc files and MagickWand-config
(/usr/local/az/libexec/ImageMagick-6/bin), and etc/ImageMagick-6 with the
policy of graphics/ImageMagick7/files/policy.xml, which the libraries read.
The programs are ImageMagick6 (convert, identify, ...) or ImageMagick67
(convert6, identify6, ...); imagick6 of PHP links these libraries. Versions
and options: share/doc/ImageMagick6/VERSIONS.
